  ROUTE CRITERION, recomputed from preserved bytes
  RESPONSIVE = non-empty AND does not echo the instruction
  ELIGIBLE   = responsive on at least 6 of 8

  route              n   responsive(as-run)  responsive(echo fixed)  echoed  loads  oldKept
  V1_comment_only   8   5/8                 4/8                     2       4      4
  V2_indent_primer  8   8/8                 6/8                     2       6      4
  V3_chat           8   7/8                 7/8                     1       1      1

  ELIGIBLE: V2_indent_primer (6/8, loads 6)  |  V3_chat (7/8, loads 1)
  CHOSEN:   V2_indent_primer   (most candidates that load)
